{
    "title": "Lingo Legend Language Learning",
    "description": "Learn a language while playing language learning games! Master Spanish, French, Mandarin, Korean, Japanese, Italian, German, Portuguese, Dutch, or Russian with our innovative language learning games. Dive into a fantasy world where learning languages is an adventure. Now featuring two exciting game modes!\r\n\r\n*Farm Mode*\r\n- Practice your language skills in a cozy, relaxing environment within the enchanting world of Lingo Legend.\r\n- Plant and harvest crops, unlocking infrastructure to expand your farm.\r\n- Customize your dream farm with tons of unique decorations.\r\n- Breed and care for adorable farm animals, the naala.\r\n- Meet new villagers and build lasting friendships.\r\n\r\n*Adventure Mode*\r\n- Test your language learning skills in strategic monster battles.\r\n- Draw ability cards from a personalized deck and answer language flashcards to use them.\r\n- Collect cards, choose your strategy, and build your deck.\r\n- Embark on perilous journeys, meet captivating characters, and complete quests.\r\n- Explore a dynamic, mysterious world filled with beautiful landscapes.\r\n- Find recipes, gather materials, and craft gear to gain experience and style.\r\n- Play as a customizable avatar with unique gear to collect and equip.\r\n- Personalize your camp with tons of unlockable content.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by language learning experts, Lingo Legend offers over 200 categories of grammar, vocabulary, and common phrases. It's the perfect app to complement or kick-start your language learning journey. Lingo Legend isn't just another language learning app\u2014it's a real game!\r\n\r\n*Supported Languages*\r\n- French (France & Canadian)\r\n- Spanish\r\n- Japanese\r\n- Korean\r\n- Mandarin Chinese\r\n- German\r\n- Italian\r\n- Portuguese (Brazilian & European)\r\n- Dutch\r\n- Russian\r\n\r\n*Educational Features*\r\n- Developed by language learning experts passionate about keeping you engaged.\r\n- Learn words and phrases relevant to everyday life with themes like Ordering Food and Meeting New People.\r\n- Ensure long-term retention with our spaced-repetition algorithm.\r\n- Define your learning path and practice what you want, when you want.\r\n\r\nDownload Lingo Legend now and revolutionize your language learning with fun and interactive language games!\r\n\r\nHave questions? Want to connect with us?\r\nContact support - support@lingolegend.com\r\nJoin Discord - https://discord.gg/TzWJSfzf4R\r\nFollow on Twitter - https://twitter.com/LingoLegend\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy - https://www.lingolegend.com/privacy-policy\r\nTerms of Use - https://www.lingolegend.com/terms-of-use",
    "descriptionHTML": "Learn a language while playing language learning games! Master Spanish, French, Mandarin, Korean, Japanese, Italian, German, Portuguese, Dutch, or Russian with our innovative language learning games. Dive into a fantasy world where learning languages is an adventure. Now featuring two exciting game modes!<br><br>*Farm Mode*<br>- Practice your language skills in a cozy, relaxing environment within the enchanting world of Lingo Legend.<br>- Plant and harvest crops, unlocking infrastructure to expand your farm.<br>- Customize your dream farm with tons of unique decorations.<br>- Breed and care for adorable farm animals, the naala.<br>- Meet new villagers and build lasting friendships.<br><br>*Adventure Mode*<br>- Test your language learning skills in strategic monster battles.<br>- Draw ability cards from a personalized deck and answer language flashcards to use them.<br>- Collect cards, choose your strategy, and build your deck.<br>- Embark on perilous journeys, meet captivating characters, and complete quests.<br>- Explore a dynamic, mysterious world filled with beautiful landscapes.<br>- Find recipes, gather materials, and craft gear to gain experience and style.<br>- Play as a customizable avatar with unique gear to collect and equip.<br>- Personalize your camp with tons of unlockable content.<br><br>Developed by language learning experts, Lingo Legend offers over 200 categories of grammar, vocabulary, and common phrases. It&#39;s the perfect app to complement or kick-start your language learning journey. Lingo Legend isn&#39;t just another language learning app\u2014it&#39;s a real game!<br><br>*Supported Languages*<br>- French (France &amp; Canadian)<br>- Spanish<br>- Japanese<br>- Korean<br>- Mandarin Chinese<br>- German<br>- Italian<br>- Portuguese (Brazilian &amp; European)<br>- Dutch<br>- Russian<br><br>*Educational Features*<br>- Developed by language learning experts passionate about keeping you engaged.<br>- Learn words and phrases relevant to everyday life with themes like Ordering Food and Meeting New People.<br>- Ensure long-term retention with our spaced-repetition algorithm.<br>- Define your learning path and practice what you want, when you want.<br><br>Download Lingo Legend now and revolutionize your language learning with fun and interactive language games!<br><br>Have questions? Want to connect with us?<br>Contact support - support@lingolegend.com<br>Join Discord - https://discord.gg/TzWJSfzf4R<br>Follow on Twitter - https://twitter.com/LingoLegend<br><br>Privacy Policy - https://www.lingolegend.com/privacy-policy<br>Terms of Use - https://www.lingolegend.com/terms-of-use",
